#: chemotools.adaptation._direct_standardization.DirectStandardization:1 of
msgid ""
"Direct Standardization (DS) is a transformer used for domain adaptation "
"(calibration ) applications. The transformer uses least squares to find a"
" linear map from the target instrument space to the source instrument "
"space, following the implementation by [1]_."
msgstr ""
"直接标准化（DS）是一种用于域适配（校准）应用的转换器。该转换器依照 [1]_ 的实现，使用最小二乘法寻找"
"从目标仪器空间到源仪器空间的线性映射。"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.DirectStandardization.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: chemotools.adaptation._direct_standardization.DirectStandardization:6 of
msgid "The transformer has no constructor hyperparameters."
msgstr "此转换器没有构造函数超参数。"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.DirectStandardization.rst
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

#: chemotools.adaptation._direct_standardization.DirectStandardization:8 of
msgid ""
"Right singular vectors of the target transfer data X, used as the column "
"basis of the low-rank transformation. Empty (shape ``(n_features, 0)``) "
"when no ``X_source`` was provided."
msgstr ""
"目标转移数据 X 的右奇异向量，用作低秩变换的列基。未提供 ``X_source`` 时为空（形状为 ``(n_features, 0)``）。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._direct_standardization.DirectStandardization:13 of
msgid ""
"Projection of the source transfer data onto the singular basis.  The full"
" transformation is ``X @ V_ds_ @ B_ds_``, which is algebraically "
"equivalent to ``X @ T_`` but requires only ``O(n_features × "
"n_transfer_samples)`` storage instead of ``O(n_features²)``."
msgstr ""
"源转移数据在奇异向量基上的投影。完整变换为 ``X @ V_ds_ @ B_ds_``，在代数上等价于 ``X @ T_``，"
"但仅需 ``O(n_features × n_transfer_samples)`` 存储空间，而非 ``O(n_features²)``。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._direct_standardization.DirectStandardization:20 of
msgid "Boolean value to flag if X_source was provided during fitting"
msgstr "标记拟合期间是否提供 X_source 的布尔值"

